        "text": "Information Technology",
        "title": "Critical Infrastructure Sectors",
        "category": "other"
      },
      {
        "text": "Keysight IxChariot Endpoint, Hawkeye, IxTap, IxByPass, and IxProbe contain one or more buffer overflow vulnerabilities. In the worst case, a remote unauthenticated attacker could execute arbitrary code.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Upgrade to latest versions.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
